<description><![CDATA[<div>美国航班停飞禁令已经解除，可以恢复航班起飞，但恢复正常需要一段时间。<br/>交通部长肖恩·达菲称，美国的航路交通管制系统非常老旧，路由器数据过载，不同路由器的数据不一致，因此导致系统关闭。达菲呼吁国会紧急拨款用于系统升级。<br/>（<a href="https://apnews.com/live/ground-stop-aviation-flights-news-updates-11-13-2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">美联社</a>，<a href="https://edition.cnn.com/2026/11/13/us/live-news/flights-ground-stop-faa" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">CNN</a>）</div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/Ct_y1NI0rmhwbOcsWyOsQsm3ZK1j6AbbJ7cHQP-OAxrjWtG746r2hWa1GnwKYdR3X4Knk9bO1Dq1sFHtTSP7vJxpx67PnFX1tcpZY92Wk5oSkaA-GJEEJ1Mpc3iJ3_iY7zs_1PxD945eDjfhaXS8Ql4aNihKvlKrzSXjnvXXWjRdRr-krYPEEiV7sUqa1aSEiYLBCKlqHC37i_g31sYz3kSwKYmh_H2W4lc-fByGnE78zvHnQ3S-2HGoTlNi-Wta-JIzs-r2f-PdNXNdHLgVGr2m7ld0xeeJmjzd8GzRsIkGQRE49PapEBMjhWjQ7PII6jZNykEIeiZDUiz_KKB-BA.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p>]]></description>
