<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 02:23:23 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto">西班牙11月11日爆发全国性大罢工和示威活动。<br/>此次大罢工由西班牙工人委员会和劳工总联盟组织发起，呼吁解决住房成本上涨、工资购买力下降等问题，并要求改善公共服务。<br/>工会表示，全国范围内约400万人参加罢工。西班牙各地的交通和公共服务严重中断。多地爆发罢工者与警方冲突，超50人被捕。<br/>（<a href="https://www.news.cn/20261112/ab9e2ec730e041e290450ec0ff7fbc75/c.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">新华社</a>，<a href="https://edition.cnn.com/2026/11/11/europe/spain-strike-housing-latam-intl" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">CNN</a>）</div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/VDF-M2wyW_-IyY2XgBRmqL9f6BlX8lqAm_i3m1d0i5bWyhDnEY8Y4JY4YeUWy8YzopA6SNB9UkX--uei1Vz9Zci8Gon7W8sKER0Ib9M2QXkRbKWDiW87ASP6CWzndnJrbf6fx_PtMo2-yKpUaTx6SEvMFtml74KGTCzP9C_v1W_KZROGIq79s2_YTErCAWoWv6gx4YqiCPS7pqngEwdLf0MlxHnIxxzKZkPFwvY-hIJYMxznMotZnCfdYSp2Qin4RRMQOGVthrypZB1rNh9LqLu1Jj08WDN2Cse2Vva_PpG3Q981lql7t6cb5aQ1Cd9NJ7osKCFGZvVr_f-ZRLxWBQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/Bi1NyVU4UFCIWumxuOsTsCA2wbcZhMwlpXGtHDrOKpRdP2bJnq1cXUkU6F6OoT3wqErTtocnWxP7vbfQvSgW5GFo7tkDi4XsZBR0KhZRPa2lGGkHd0Asc_R327luCLiAPU4VaMJU2Xapq05eH74hd7WkxXzUZCbB3hAUF5NNjH_2JzbSpFvuFTHQOOykqFJwcfwX-BoUL49zZCYyQBZVhofvZMbIArEMZ1qV_Oo5wjv3yW5NGL674v-aPEXvJjwp5rVMhAZNFEbnwBMuFryn4AjcluJQ43n5UjdSmQyENSKNqmMDmYSs-P8TwW1rcdbd9KAII1ldRbQWSGwK5VoOjg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/Jy9XMqiouWMlMWb2a8rPfyg151-lndR_LpHtvTtOwIDrpwIxqC-qckEtVgkssmBO40g4Uoa6626x9axavbvvOvOD6Yjy7WlOPPKUjeLQTPFI6c4nXh8Cg7JWmBshVAdGgx9YHxZmfxj4HxhUVlB992JPia3nh4bJZqP1jl7wEliDc5nts6ijEoqMgL7JnWeIa8qFx3JBUzoOM6BuTujwcr0lmH-88OqOqUgPrmKf77spy-1GeEj8ExQmFF9rggG_KJRSoBqsLLuzbguUd9fEl0dRwplSgEI66oNwRA9Y0CCRcYbcSWcF7JSagIDy1RGHHzDD-R7jJ0WJI5mfy2ycnw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%